        {
          "text": "Ngaaya makani aakasika kuli-Jeremiya kuzwa kuli-Jehova, Nebuzaradana silutwe wampi naakamana kumwaangununa kuzwa ku-Rama, naakamutolede ulaangidwe munkeetani akati kabantu boonse ba-Jerusalemu aba-Juda ibakatolwa mubuzike ku-Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
