        {
          "text": "Na ulayanda kusyaala, mbubo, piluka kuli-Gedaliya mwana wa-Ahikamu mwana waSafani, ngonguwe mwami wa-Babuloni ngwaakabika kuti aendelezye minzi ya-Juda. Koya ukakale awe akati kabantu. Kufumbwa kuntu kubota mumeso aako, koya nkuko. Lino wakamupa bulilu acipo, wamuleka kuti ainke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
